### Next Steps for Deployment
To enable Speed Insights on Vercel:
1. Navigate to the Vercel dashboard
2. Select this project
3. Click on "Speed Insights" in the sidebar
4. Click the "Enable" button
5. Deploy the application to Vercel

Once deployed and enabled, Speed Insights will automatically begin collecting performance metrics at `/_vercel/speed-insights/*` routes.
